---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | FULL TIME" description="Privacy policy for fulltimefootball.net. How we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <main style="max-width:740px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.25rem 4rem;">
    <h1 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--c-muted);margin-bottom:2rem;">Last updated: 9 October 2026</p>

    <p>This privacy policy describes how FULL TIME (fulltimefootball.net) collects and uses information when you visit the site.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">Information we collect</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics 4 to collect anonymised data about how visitors use the site, including pages viewed, time on site, and general geographic location. This data does not identify you personally. We also use Google AdSense to display advertisements, which may use cookies to show relevant ads based on your browsing history.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site uses cookies for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Analytics (Google Analytics 4): to understand how visitors use the site</li>
      <li>Advertising (Google AdSense): to display relevant advertisements</li>
      <li>Theme preference: to remember your chosen light or dark mode setting</li>
      <li>Language preference: to remember your chosen translation language</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time. Some features of the site may not function correctly if you do.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">Google AdSense and advertising</h2>
    <p>We use Google AdSense to display advertisements on this site. Google may use cookies to personalise ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. For more information on how Google uses data, visit <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">Newsletter</h2>
    <p>If you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect only your email address. We use it solely to send you football content updates and will never share it with third parties. You can unsubscribe at any time.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">Third-party links</h2>
    <p>Our articles may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to read their privacy policies.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:benjamingathukumuthoni@gmail.com">benjamingathukumuthoni@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <p style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--c-muted);font-size:0.9rem;">FULL TIME is operated by Bengamu Technology Solutions, Nairobi, Kenya.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
